WEBVTT

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:06.220
The wishes come together to 
form a new shining star!

00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:07.910
Become the path that lights the way!

00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:10.090
Synchro Summon!

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:13.360
Soar, Stardust Dragon!

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:20.300
Level 1 Synchron Resonator 
tunes Level 7 Star Gatherer!

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:24.200
The pulse of the King now forms a line here!

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:26.470
Witness the power of the rumbling heavens!

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:28.470
Synchro Summon!

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:32.520
My soul! Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:38.160
I won't hold back, Yusei!

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:42.360
Red Dragon Archfiend attacks Stardust Dragon!

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:44.920
Absolute Powerforce!

00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:48.160
I activate the trap Star Excursion!

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:52.780
When Synchro Monsters battle, both 
monsters are removed from play,

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:57.750
and they're Special Summoned at
the end of your third turn's Battle Phase!

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:02.370
Stardust Dragon and Red 
Dragon Archfiend vanished.

00:01:02.630 --> 00:01:05.740
Yeah. They both vanished 
into our futures.

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:07.210
Future?

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:09.650
Future?

00:01:11.480 --> 00:01:12.540
That's right!

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:15.850
I will find my future in this duel!

00:01:18.050 --> 00:01:21.020
I set one card and end my turn!

00:01:25.780 --> 00:01:27.660
Riding Duels.

00:01:27.660 --> 00:01:30.720
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:37.320
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:45.350
Run! The road of evolution leading to tomorrow

00:01:45.350 --> 00:01:49.890
Is a new legendary duel

00:02:01.860 --> 00:02:06.850
Throw away all feelings of failure

00:02:07.370 --> 00:02:12.470
Set free your infinite potential

00:02:12.470 --> 00:02:18.080
Every beginning is up to you

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:24.690
Everyone is lost Pursue the light

00:02:24.690 --> 00:02:29.990
Losing sight of fleeting dreams

00:02:29.990 --> 00:02:35.560
Connect the bond and you'll never lose

00:02:37.530 --> 00:02:43.410
Become the gale and dance Cut through the darkness

00:02:43.410 --> 00:02:48.610
Even if you can't see your destination

00:02:48.610 --> 00:02:54.080
Run on your feet without fear

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:59.950
On this road that leads to tomorrow

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:07.480
Going my way!! Break through and go!

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:26.810
Clashing Souls!

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:30.700
My turn!

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:49.660
I send one monster to the graveyard 
to Special Summon Quickdraw Synchron!

00:03:53.840 --> 00:03:58.890
By Special Summoning two Triangle Tokens 
to your field in defense position,

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:02.680
I can Special Summon
Triangle Warrior from my hand!

00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:05.080
Tokens on my field?

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:07.980
Come, Triangle Warrior!

00:04:14.630 --> 00:04:19.130
Level 5 Quickdraw Synchron 
tunes Level 2 Triangle Warrior!

00:04:22.930 --> 00:04:26.170
Our thoughts combine  
to call forth a new power!

00:04:26.170 --> 00:04:27.700
Become the path that lights the way!

00:04:29.340 --> 00:04:30.540
Synchro Summon!

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:33.220
Burn up, Nitro Warrior!

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:38.250
From my hand, I activate 
Speed Spell - Defense Buster!

00:04:38.760 --> 00:04:40.720
When I have 2 or more Speed Counters,

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:44.940
one of your monsters in defense 
position switches to attack position!

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:48.140
I see.

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:51.690
That's why you summoned a Token on my field.

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:55.160
Nitro Warrior's effect activates!

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:58.440
When a spell card activates during my turn,

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:02.500
it gains 1000 attack points during 
damage calculation once!

00:05:03.190 --> 00:05:08.500
Since I used a Speed Spell, Nitro 
Warrior has 3800 attack points!

00:05:10.260 --> 00:05:12.700
3800 attack points?

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:14.890
He did more than increase its attack points.

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:18.650
With Nitro Warrior's effect, when it 
destroys the opponent's monster,

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:23.290
it can change another monster in defense 
position to attack position and battle again.

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:26.370
If he destroys the other Token,

00:05:26.730 --> 00:05:30.830
it's a total of 4200 points of
damage for a one turn kill.

00:05:31.460 --> 00:05:35.800
Yusei really is battling 
with all his power.

00:05:36.210 --> 00:05:40.270
Yusei said that he would 
find the future in this duel.

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:45.750
It may not just be for himself. 
It may also be a message for us.

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:50.390
We also have to find our future.

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:03.100
Nitro Warrior attacks the 
first Triangle Token!

00:06:03.690 --> 00:06:05.230
Dynamite Knuckle!

00:06:07.030 --> 00:06:09.500
I activate the trap Break Tune!

00:06:09.940 --> 00:06:16.680
When you attack, I Special Summon one 
Tuner Monster and negate that attack!

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:19.480
I Special Summon Influence Dragon!

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:28.380
Nitro Warrior's attack 
points return to normal.

00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:31.500
Don't get overconfident, Yusei!

00:06:31.830 --> 00:06:35.860
Did you really think that our 
clash will end in a single move?

00:06:36.240 --> 00:06:39.600
The curtains won't fall until 
the lead actor gives his final speech!

00:06:39.600 --> 00:06:44.440
And the lead actor of this 
duel is me, Jack Atlas!

00:06:46.240 --> 00:06:47.410
I end my turn!

00:06:47.810 --> 00:06:48.970
Incredible.

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:50.610
Even Jack isn't taking a step back.

00:06:50.610 --> 00:06:53.340
Jack is already focused on his future.

00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:56.580
His strength is confident and unwavering.

00:06:57.140 --> 00:06:59.580
I'm jealous of him.

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:01.740
Me too.

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:06.660
My turn!

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:11.030
When Influence Dragon is 
used as Synchro Material,

00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:14.670
the Warrior-Type Triangle 
Token becomes Dragon-Type!

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:19.140
I'll use these Token eyesores 
as seeds for victory!

00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:25.260
Level 3 Influence Dragon tunes 
two Level 2 Triangle Tokens!

00:07:26.580 --> 00:07:30.580
He was in a pinch, but he's now using 
the Triangle Tokens to his advantage.

00:07:31.120 --> 00:07:33.180
The King's roar reverberates!

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:36.090
The iron hammer of victory 
will destroy the land!

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:38.320
Synchro Summon!

00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:42.120
Take flight, Exploder Dragonwing!

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:45.590
But Nitro Warrior has more attack points!

00:07:45.590 --> 00:07:46.770
I know that!

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:49.060
I summon Power Supplier in defense position!

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:58.490
Due to Power Supplier's effect, 
Exploder Dragonwing gains 400 attack points!

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:01.480
Now their attack points are equal.

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:05.820
Exploder Dragonwing attacks Nitro Warrior!

00:08:05.820 --> 00:08:07.580
King Storm!

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:18.330
Even though their attack points are equal, 
only Nitro Warrior was destroyed!

00:08:24.240 --> 00:08:30.070
When Exploder Dragonwing battles a monster 
with equal or fewer attack points,

00:08:30.430 --> 00:08:35.800
your monster is destroyed without calculating damage, 
and you take damage equal to its attack points!

00:08:35.800 --> 00:08:40.340
Yusei, do you now know 
my absolute power?

00:08:40.340 --> 00:08:43.300
There's nothing you can do since 
you have zero cards in your hand!

00:08:44.150 --> 00:08:45.450
Incredible.

00:08:45.450 --> 00:08:47.720
2800 points of damage!

00:08:47.720 --> 00:08:52.390
And since there was no damage calculation, 
Exploder Dragonwing is unhurt.

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:53.960
Yusei...

00:08:55.650 --> 00:08:58.100
I set one card and end my turn!

00:09:07.840 --> 00:09:10.380
This is my overwhelmingly powerful strength!

00:09:10.800 --> 00:09:13.720
Yusei, if you're the sword, I'm the axe!

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:17.280
I'll swing it down and split you apart!

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:22.070
I'll annihilate your foolish 
soul for challenging a giant!

00:09:23.390 --> 00:09:24.230
What?

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:26.760
Too bad, but we're traveling
different paths.

00:09:27.220 --> 00:09:29.440
My path is with the wind.

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:32.270
You can't stop it with a giant axe!

00:09:34.020 --> 00:09:35.200
Big talk.

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:37.030
You bring it out of me.

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:39.910
I won't let you have this duel!

00:09:40.400 --> 00:09:42.870
Wrong! Victory is something you take!

00:09:44.880 --> 00:09:50.050
Yusei is enjoying this duel 
from the bottom of his heart.

00:09:50.260 --> 00:09:51.960
Yeah. Jack too.

00:09:52.550 --> 00:09:54.750
He's happy that he can 
use his full strength.

00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:00.700
My turn!

00:10:04.710 --> 00:10:06.570
Sneak Giant's effect.

00:10:06.570 --> 00:10:09.130
When you're the only one 
with monsters on his field,

00:10:09.520 --> 00:10:12.590
by Special Summoning a Level 1 
monster from my graveyard,

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:16.340
I can summon Level 5
 Sneak Giant without tribute!

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:20.790
I Special Summon Turbo Synchron 
and summon Sneak Giant!

00:10:23.510 --> 00:10:27.620
Level 1 Turbo Synchron 
tunes Level 5 Sneak Giant!

00:10:29.090 --> 00:10:32.360
The bond comes together to 
call forth a new power!

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:33.960
Become the path that lights the way!

00:10:34.560 --> 00:10:35.630
Synchro Summon!

00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:38.190
Roar, Turbo Warrior!

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:45.240
Turbo Warrior attacks Exploder Dragonwing!

00:10:48.420 --> 00:10:52.540
When Turbo Warrior attacks
a Level 6-or-above Synchro Monster,

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:55.310
that monster's attack points are halved!

00:10:55.600 --> 00:10:59.550
Its 2800 attack points 
are halved to 1400!

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:01.780
Go, Turbo Warrior!

00:11:02.020 --> 00:11:03.530
Accel Slash!

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:18.130
Well done, Yusei!

00:11:18.680 --> 00:11:19.700
I told you.

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:21.530
You bring this out of me.

00:11:29.280 --> 00:11:31.660
It's Yusei's counterattack!

00:11:31.660 --> 00:11:33.320
What attack and defense!

00:11:33.320 --> 00:11:35.020
Even I'm getting fired up!

00:11:35.320 --> 00:11:37.220
Yusei! Jack!

00:11:37.720 --> 00:11:43.290
Yusei has always fought 
for others, even for me.

00:11:45.710 --> 00:11:48.630
Yusei protected me.

00:11:49.260 --> 00:11:51.640
He embraced me by dueling.

00:11:53.010 --> 00:11:55.880
Yusei always fought for others,

00:11:56.160 --> 00:12:02.080
but he's now dueling for himself 
in order to find his future.

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:06.250
That makes me happy.
Therefore, I'll also...

00:12:07.540 --> 00:12:13.910
I want a future where I'll be the one
embracing and protecting someone.

00:12:20.370 --> 00:12:21.510
I end my turn!

00:12:23.090 --> 00:12:24.600
My turn!

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:32.940
When you're the only one 
with a Synchro Monster,

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:36.490
I can summon the Tuner 
Monster Mirror Resonator!

00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:44.900
Mirror Resonator's Level becomes the same as 
your Synchro Monster Turbo Warrior!

00:12:46.360 --> 00:12:51.020
Level 6 Mirror Resonator 
tunes Level 2 Power Supplier!

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:56.550
The King's decision becomes a crimson 
blade overflowing with red flames!

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:59.620
Overcome the hot surging seas and appear!

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:01.970
Synchro Summon!

00:13:02.790 --> 00:13:05.570
The fierce god of flames, Crimson Blader!

00:13:08.440 --> 00:13:11.410
Crimson Blader attacks Turbo Warrior!

00:13:11.940 --> 00:13:12.880
Red Murder!

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:21.550
Turbo Warrior...

00:13:22.450 --> 00:13:26.090
When Crimson Blader destroys 
a Synchro Monster in battle,

00:13:26.090 --> 00:13:30.290
you can't summon a monster 
on your next turn, Yusei!

00:13:30.630 --> 00:13:33.500
So this is the results 
of your training, Jack!

00:13:34.240 --> 00:13:38.140
I focused on many techniques 
for my power duel

00:13:38.140 --> 00:13:40.470
so that my dueling would 
create even more power.

00:13:40.950 --> 00:13:42.940
I'm close to perfection!

00:13:45.320 --> 00:13:47.400
Jack...  Yusei...

00:13:47.910 --> 00:13:50.410
Because of them, I...

00:13:54.070 --> 00:13:59.880
They taught me to never give up.

00:14:03.380 --> 00:14:09.060
They gave me the courage and power 
to protect Luca as her older brother.

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:14.570
Thanks to Yusei and everyone,

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:19.560
I got the strength to face my 
mission instead of running from it.

00:14:21.810 --> 00:14:23.780
Thank you, Yusei.

00:14:27.780 --> 00:14:28.880
My turn!

00:14:30.840 --> 00:14:33.900
I activate Speed Spell -
 Angel Baton from my hand!

00:14:35.300 --> 00:14:37.560
When I have 2 or more Speed Counters,

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:41.460
I draw two cards from my deck, and I send 
one card in my hand to the graveyard!

00:14:42.740 --> 00:14:46.220
You drew a good card after 
having zero cards in your hand.

00:14:46.710 --> 00:14:50.970
But this draw will
 determine your fate!

00:15:03.110 --> 00:15:09.260
I drew a monster, but due to Crimson 
Blader's effect, I can't summon a monster.

00:15:09.850 --> 00:15:12.970
My field will remain empty.

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:15.530
Which one should I send to the graveyard?

00:15:20.450 --> 00:15:22.740
I send Fake Gardna to the graveyard.

00:15:23.090 --> 00:15:25.310
I set one card and end my turn!

00:15:25.710 --> 00:15:30.440
You drew a monster, but it can only
go to the graveyard if you can't summon it!

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:32.080
We'll see about that.

00:15:32.080 --> 00:15:34.150
Do you know what I'm thinking?

00:15:34.610 --> 00:15:36.620
I already know what you're planning!

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:39.480
You sent Fake Gardna to the graveyard,

00:15:39.480 --> 00:15:43.160
but you can Special Summon it 
when you're attacked directly.

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:48.980
When Crimson Blader attacks you directly, 
you're going to use it as a shield to survive!

00:15:48.980 --> 00:15:51.130
Only you would pull 
such a petty strategy!

00:15:52.710 --> 00:15:54.600
We never change.

00:15:57.280 --> 00:16:05.380
We'll spend our entire lives thinking 
about dueling, cards, pride and fixations.

00:16:05.380 --> 00:16:07.880
Yeah, that will never change!

00:16:07.880 --> 00:16:10.850
The present, the past or the future!

00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:14.380
They're right.

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:24.830
I can't change how I duel either.

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:26.320
Crow, show us how to duel!

00:16:26.320 --> 00:16:27.960
Let's duel!

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:34.320
I've been dueling for the children 
 because I wanted to see them smile.

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:36.020
That's how I duel.

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:37.610
In that case...

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:40.200
My turn!

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:46.080
You said that when this 
turn's Battle Phase ends,

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:50.450
my Red Dragon Archfiend and 
your Stardust Dragon return!

00:16:50.740 --> 00:16:55.690
But I won't wait for that future! 
 I'll end it this turn!

00:16:56.190 --> 00:16:59.160
Crimson Blader attacks Yusei directly!

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:02.630
Jack attacked even though  
he knows that it'll be blocked!

00:17:03.380 --> 00:17:04.940
Red Murder!

00:17:06.570 --> 00:17:13.740
When you attack me directly, I can Special 
Summon Fake Gardna in defense position!

00:17:17.780 --> 00:17:21.020
Your survival strategy
won't work against me!

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:23.740
I activate the trap Breakthrough!

00:17:23.740 --> 00:17:26.990
It destroys the monster Special
Summoned during the Battle Phase!

00:17:29.300 --> 00:17:30.160
This is bad!

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:33.440
If Yusei takes a direct attack, he loses!

00:17:33.440 --> 00:17:36.070
Fake Gardna was removed from play
when it was destroyed,

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:37.670
so it can't activate its effect again.

00:17:37.670 --> 00:17:39.130
This is the end!

00:17:43.320 --> 00:17:45.440
I activate the trap Scramble Egg!

00:17:45.760 --> 00:17:46.640
What?

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:49.600
When a monster on my field is destroyed,

00:17:49.600 --> 00:17:53.510
I can Special Summon Sonic Chick 
from my deck, hand or graveyard!

00:17:59.270 --> 00:18:01.070
Even though it only has 300 defense points,

00:18:01.070 --> 00:18:05.460
Sonic Chick can't be destroyed in battle 
against a monster with 1900 or more attack points!

00:18:11.680 --> 00:18:17.870
Since the Battle Phase ends, due to 
the trap card Star Excursion's effect,

00:18:17.870 --> 00:18:21.350
Stardust Dragon and Red 
Dragon Archfiend resurrect!

00:18:39.780 --> 00:18:43.660
Stardust Dragon and Red Dragon 
Archfiend resurrected.

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:46.060
The future that Yusei mentioned...

00:18:46.710 --> 00:18:48.330
What does Yusei see?

00:19:00.870 --> 00:19:05.990
During my battle against Z-one, 
my father spoke to my heart.

00:19:08.870 --> 00:19:10.260
About what I must do.

00:19:11.760 --> 00:19:17.400
Like Moment's Yusei Particles, I must 
guide and connect people's hearts.

00:19:18.630 --> 00:19:22.270
Connecting people forms a bond.

00:19:22.570 --> 00:19:25.880
Even if everyone goes their separate ways,

00:19:26.530 --> 00:19:32.210
I want to become the bond that connects 
everyone's hearts, like Yusei Particles.

00:19:32.790 --> 00:19:34.420
That's why we don't need
to feel confused.

00:19:34.790 --> 00:19:38.180
We can all stand and head out alone.

00:19:39.160 --> 00:19:40.150
Yusei...

00:19:41.190 --> 00:19:42.120
Yusei...

00:19:42.710 --> 00:19:44.150
Yusei!

00:19:44.150 --> 00:19:45.090
Yusei...

00:19:45.460 --> 00:19:47.020
Then I'll stand!

00:19:47.020 --> 00:19:49.560
I'll head into the world as the King!

00:19:49.860 --> 00:19:56.530
Yusei, witness my rugged soul to the end!

00:19:57.740 --> 00:20:00.040
Yeah! Bring it on, Jack!

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:02.940
I activate Speed World 2's effect!

00:20:03.460 --> 00:20:08.110
By removing 7 Speed 
Counters, I draw one card!

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:13.080
I summon Chain Resonator!

00:20:17.160 --> 00:20:22.790
When I summon Chain Resonator 
when you have a Synchro Monster,

00:20:23.110 --> 00:20:27.960
I can Special Summon a Resonator 
Tuner Monster from my deck!

00:20:30.280 --> 00:20:32.930
I Special Summon Dark Resonator!

00:20:37.060 --> 00:20:41.840
My soul is running wild!

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:50.250
Level 3 Dark Resonator and Level 1 Chain 
Resonator double tune Level 8 Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:20:51.110 --> 00:20:54.080
The king and devil now merge here!

00:20:54.080 --> 00:20:58.290
Rugged soul! Give the roar 
that created heaven and earth!

00:20:58.530 --> 00:20:59.760
Synchro Summon!

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:03.690
Come, Red Nova Dragon!

00:21:07.110 --> 00:21:13.510
Red Nova Dragon gains 500 attack points 
for every Tuner Monster in my graveyard!

00:21:14.320 --> 00:21:16.950
There are five Tuner 
Monsters in my graveyard!

00:21:16.950 --> 00:21:22.660
Therefore, Red Nova Dragon 
gains 2500 attack points!

00:21:25.800 --> 00:21:27.080
Incredible!

00:21:27.080 --> 00:21:28.990
6000 attack points?

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:34.200
Jack is striking Yusei with his entire soul.

00:21:34.490 --> 00:21:36.900
How will Yusei respond?

00:22:06.330 --> 00:22:11.460
If the world is endless, prove it to my heart

00:22:11.700 --> 00:22:16.840
If we shed the same tears, let's laugh together

00:22:16.840 --> 00:22:22.210
Freed reality forms phrases in the piercing beat

00:22:22.210 --> 00:22:24.980
Our hearts resonate

00:22:24.980 --> 00:22:30.180
As the nameless flower blooms with sound

00:22:30.180 --> 00:22:36.790
We'll find a place for us

00:22:38.660 --> 00:22:43.900
Waking in a dream Stretch our hands toward the future

00:22:43.900 --> 00:22:48.930
Grab and release repeatedly as we search

00:22:49.400 --> 00:22:55.110
Repaint the darkness with the colors we envision

00:22:55.110 --> 00:23:03.410
Overlaying memories, bonds and hope creates future color

00:23:03.410 --> 00:23:09.320
We will draw it forever
